          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.9999505861798993,
          "sentence": "Understanding it helps people respond with practical strategies instead of shame, and it reminds teachers, employers, and peers to create settings where communication skills can grow gradually and safely.",
